"{{Term/Store|Luminous Stone Gathering||Series, BotW}}" is a [[Side Quest]] in {{BotW}}.<ref>{{Cite|{{Big|Luminous Stone Gathering}}<br/>{{Color BotW|Side Quest|Zora's Domain}}|Adventure Log|BotW}}</ref>

==Overview==
After [[Link]] has met with [[King Dorephan]], he can speak to [[Ledo]], who explains that he and [[Fronk]] have been working on repairing the damage to [[Zora's Domain]] caused by [[Divine Beast Vah Ruta]].<ref>{{Cite|That's why my senior apprentice, Fronk, and I are repairing the domain. However, our materials are a bit depleted...|Ledo|BotW}}</ref> When Link inquires further, Ledo explains that repairing the Domain requires [[Luminous Stone]]s, which are plentiful in [[Upland Zorana]].<ref>{{Cite|[Materials?] Yes... Repairs require a large number of {{Color BotW|Blue|luminous stones}}. You can find plenty of them around {{Color BotW|Blue|Upland Zorana}}.|Ledo|BotW}}</ref> Ledo asks him if he has found any Luminous Stones on his journey.<ref>{{Cite|Have you, by chance, already stumbled across some {{Color BotW|Blue|luminous stones}} during your travels?|Ledo|BotW}}</ref> He asks for 10, which would help him greatly with repairs.<ref>{{Cite|For instance, if you have {{Color BotW|Red|10 of them}}, that would be a big help...|Ledo|BotW}}</ref>

Once Link has retrieved 10 Luminous Stones, he can return to Zora's Domain to give them to Ledo.<ref>{{Cite|Thank you! You're really giving me {{Color BotW|Red|10}} {{Color BotW|Blue|luminous stones}}?!|Ledo|BotW}}</ref> He then counts out all 10 of them,<ref>{{Cite|In that case, please excuse me while I count them! {{Big|And a oooone! And a twooooo! And a threeeeee! Foooooour! Fiiiiiive! Siiiiiiix! Seveeeeeeen! Eeeeeeeeeeight! Niiiiiiiiine! Aaaand...TEN!}}|Ledo|BotW}}</ref> and he accepts them when he confirms the number is correct.<ref>{{Cite|Oh, my! You really brought all 10! Thank you! Yes, I will happily take those {{Color BotW|Blue|luminous stones}} from you!|Ledo|BotW}}</ref> As a reward, he initially gives Link one [[Diamond]],<ref>{{Cite|Oh, that's right... I must reward you!|Ledo|BotW}}</ref> but he adds a second as a bonus.<ref>{{Cite|And what's more, I'll give you {{Color BotW|Red|one}} extra as a bonus!|Ledo|BotW}}</ref>{{Note|If Link's Diamond [[Inventory]] is full, Ledo will hold onto his Diamonds until he has room for them.<ref>{{Cite|Or...I'd like to, but you currently don't have room for {{Color BotW|Red|two more}} {{Color BotW|Blue|diamonds}}.|Ledo|BotW}}</ref><ref>{{Cite|Well... I'd like to, anyway, but you don't currently have room for {{Color BotW|Red|one more}} {{Color BotW|Blue|diamond}}.|Ledo|BotW}}</ref>}}

After this Side Quest has ended, Ledo will continue to accept groups of 10 Luminous Stones from him, though only in exchange for one Diamond.<ref>{{Cite|If you ever find yourself in possession of {{Color BotW|Red|10}} {{Color BotW|Blue|luminous stones}} in the future, I hope you will bring them to me. But if that happens, know that I'll only be able to give you {{Color BotW|Red|one}} {{Color BotW|Blue|diamond}} for them. I would be honored if you would accept it when the time comes!|Ledo|BotW}}</ref>

